{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29056","headline":"湖州韦长史山居 · 许浑","name":"湖州韦长史山居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一官唯买昼公堂，但得身闲日自长。\n琴曲少声重勘谱，药丸多忌更寻方。\n溪浮箬叶添醅绿，泉遶松根助茗香。\n明日鳜鱼何处钓，门前春水似沧浪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29056.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29056","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}